NAME: Reversi

DESCRIPTION:

The game can be played:
- Human vs Computer
- Computer vs Computer
- Human vs Human

The computer has 2 skill levels: CPU1 or CPU2.

NOTES:

The minimax algorithm with Alpha-beta pruning is used.
Reference: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alpha%E2%80%93beta_pruning

Just 2 CPU skill levels are provided because the Reversi program is
executed by the Picoc Interpreter, which is much slower than if it
were executed by compiled code.
